Found when tests/fmt_round_trip.rs (every_corpus_program_checks_the_same_after_formatting and formatting_a_core_pin_or_drop_program_keeps_its_output) refused a first draft of corpus/core/ok_par_pure_extern (B-2026-11-04-42): diagnostics [] became ["lint: unsafe block is not preceded by a `// Safety:` comment"]. The formatter always breaks a block body onto its own lines (`let x = unsafe {
